WEBVTT

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:01.221
we'd never really been on lists before.

00:04:01.221 --> 00:04:02.927
So I thought it was kind of cool

00:04:02.927 --> 00:04:05.623
when they came out with these
positive lists and we were on there.

00:04:05.623 --> 00:04:07.321
We weren't anywhere close to the top,

00:04:07.321 --> 00:04:10.818
but we were on the list, we were somebody.

00:04:10.818 --> 00:04:12.648
Best city to get a job,

00:04:12.648 --> 00:04:14.663
best city to start a business,

00:04:14.663 --> 00:04:16.456
best downtown --

00:04:16.456 --> 00:04:18.930
Oklahoma City.

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:22.235
And then came the list

00:04:22.235 --> 00:04:27.781
of the most obese cities in the country.

00:04:27.781 --> 00:04:30.884
And there we were.